6. Formal Model of Research Acceleration

6.1 Classical Research Productivity

R_{legacy} = \frac{H_{human} \times T}{F_{institutional}}

Where:
   •   H_{human} = unaided human cognition
   •   T = elapsed time
   •   F_{institutional} = access, coordination, and tooling friction

This formulation yields linear growth and high fragility.

