7. Governance as a First-Class System Property

A core design principle of AETHERMIND–Cerebra-Q is that governance scales with cognition.

Key mechanisms include:
   •   Human-in-the-loop decision checkpoints
   •   Ethical constraint propagation across models
   •   Meta-cognitive uncertainty signaling
   •   Auditability of reasoning paths

This prevents the common failure mode of high-speed systems operating beyond human comprehension or control.

